---
import '../styles/prose.css';
import { GITHUB_URL } from '../consts';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About this blog and its author.">
	<div class="container">
		<header class="page-header">
			<h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
		</header>

		<div class="prose about">
			<p>
				I'm Jiawei Liu. I'm interested in ML systems, especially how large language models are
				served: memory, scheduling, and the tooling around local inference.
			</p>
			<p>
				This site collects notes and write-ups on things I learn and build. I try to write them
				so that someone new to the area can follow along, with the commands, configs and numbers
				needed to reproduce the results.
			</p>
			<p>
				You can find my code on <a href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a>, and new posts through the{' '}
				<a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.about {
		margin-inline: 0;
	}
</style>
